flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9158628Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9159534Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9160293Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9161071Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9161982Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9162894Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9163285Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9163561Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9164062Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9164306Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9164816Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9165478Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9166096Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9166542Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9166757Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9166980Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9167297Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9167540Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9168023Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9168200Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9168335Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9168538Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9168898Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
