flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9172847Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9173181Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9173606Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9174373Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9175056Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9175692Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9176210Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9176863Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T21:02:56.9177531Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
